        "headline": "Hydrologic Outlook issued June 23 at 1:59PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "ESFAFG\n\n...Locations Impacted...\nSouthern Denali Borough-Eastern Alaska Range North of Trims\nCamp-Northern Denali Borough-Eastern Alaska Range South of Trims Camp\n\nA front is moving westward over the state. As this front progresses,\nwe are expecting widespread rain showers and thunderstorms to\ncontinue for the Alaska Range. As of 1:45pm AKST Tuesday portions of\nthe eastern Alaska Range have already reported more than 1\" of rain.\nAs of Tuesday afternoon, heavy rain continues to spread west,\nbring",
